# Brute Force Detection

## objective 
Detect repeated failed login attempts that may indicate brute-force activity.

spl 
index=* EventCode=4625
| stats count by user src_ip
| where count>=5
| sort -count

# use case 
SOC analyst use this query to detect Brute Force activity 

## Expected output 
user name 
src_ip
more than 5 or equals to 5 attempts will be appeared 
